==Strategy==
Meatshielding is essential against the peons and the boss itself. Bring along [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Catornado]] if you have it, or any quick critical hitters to get rid of the Metal Doges. Having tanky units that can withstand the damage of several Rampage Cats such as [[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Mythical Titan Cat]] is very helpful, as well as having [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] to keep pushing them back until you reach their base.

